# text = There was a dreaminess , a pre-occupation , an exaltation , in the maternal look which the girl could not understand her mother said , as soon as the last note had passed out of her Mrs Durbeyfield habitually spoke the dialect ; her daughter , who had passed the Sixth Standard in the National School under a London-trained mistress , spoke two languages : the dialect at home , more or less ; ordinary English abroad and to persons of quality Tess asked asked Tess suddenly .
