# text = On reaching the fresh air he was sufficiently unsteady to incline the row of three at one moment as if they were marching to London , and at another as if they were marching to Bath -- which produced a comical effect , frequent enough in families on nocturnal homegoings ; and , like most comical effects , not quite so comic after all .
