# text = When old Mr Simon Stoke , latterly deceased , had made his fortune as an honest merchant ( some said money-lender ) in the North , he decided to settle as a county man in the South of England , out of hail of his business district ; and in doing this he felt the necessity of recommencing with a name that would not too readily identify him with the smart tradesman of the past , and that would be less commonplace than the original bald , stark words .
