# text = Each pedestrian could see no halo but his or her own , which never deserted the head-shadow , whatever its vulgar unsteadiness might be ; but adhered to it , and persistently beautified it ; till the erratic motions seemed an inherent part of the irradiation , and the fumes of their breathing a component of the night's mist ; and the spirit of the scene , and of the moonlight , and of Nature , seemed harmoniously to mingle with the spirit of wine
