# text = The reaping-machine left the fallen corn behind it in little heaps , each heap being of the quantity for a sheaf ; and upon these the active binders in the rear laid their hands -- mainly women , but some of them men in print shirts , and trousers supported round their waists by leather straps , rendering useless the two buttons behind , which twinkled and bristled with sunbeams at every movement of each wearer , as if they were a pair of eyes in the small of his back .
