# text = Thus they all worked on , encompassed by the vast flat mead which extended to either slope of the valley -- a level landscape compounded of old landscapes long forgotten , and , no doubt , differing in character very greatly from the landscape they composed now said the dairyman , rising suddenly from a cow he had just finished off , snatching up his three-legged stool in one hand and the pail in the other , and moving on to the next hard-yielder in his vicinity said Jonathan Kail said a dairymaid replied Dairyman Crick dubiously , as though even witchcraft might be limited by anatomical possibilities interposed the milkmaid said the dairyman Songs were often resorted to in dairies hereabout as an enticement to the cows when they showed signs of withholding their usual yield ; and the band of milkers at this request burst into melody -- in purely business-like tones , it is true , and with no great spontaneity ; the result , according to their own belief , being a decided improvement during the song's continuance .
