# text = And the thorny crown of this sad conception was that she whom he really did prefer in a cursory way to the rest , she who knew herself to be more impassioned in nature , cleverer , more beautiful than they , was in the eyes of propriety far less worthy of him than the homelier ones whom he ignored Amid the oozing fatness and warm ferments of the Froom Vale , at a season when the rush of juices could almost be heard below the hiss of fertilization , it was impossible that the most fanciful love should not grow passionate .
