# text = In their sad doubts as to whether their son had himself any right whatever to the title he claimed for the unknown young woman , Mr and Mrs Clare began to feel it as an advantage not to be overlooked that she at least was sound in her views ; especially as the conjunction of the pair must have arisen by an act of Providence ; for Angel never would have made orthodoxy a condition of his choice .
