# text = Having fairly well advanced his own affairs , Angel listened in a willing silence , as they jogged on together through the shady lanes , to his father's account of his parish difficulties , and the coldness of brother clergymen whom he loved , because of his strict interpretations of the New Testament by the light of what they deemed a pernicious Calvinistic doctrine said Mr Clare , with genial scorn ; and he proceeded to recount experiences which would show the absurdity of that idea .
