# text = It was with a sense of luxury that he recognized his power of viewing life here from its inner side , in a way that had been quite foreign to him in his student-days ; and , much as he loved his parents , he could not help being aware that to come here , as now , after an experience of home-life , affected him like throwing off splints and bandages ; even the one customary curb on the humours of English rural societies being absent in this place , Talbothays having no resident landlord .
