# text = He continued Angel , suddenly recollecting that Tess was overhearing this gloomy tale , went to shut the door between the passage and the ante-room to the inner parlour where she was ; but his wife , flinging a shawl round her , had come to the outer room and was listening to the man's narrative , her eyes resting absently on the luggage and the drops of rain glistening upon it asked Tess Tess had gone back to the inner parlour , and sat down by the fire , looking wistfully into it .
