# text = With the shortening of the days all hope of obtaining her husband's forgiveness began to leave her ; and there was something of the habitude of the wild animal in the unreflecting instinct with which she rambled on -- disconnecting herself by littles from her eventful past at every step , obliterating her identity , giving no thought to accidents or contingencies which might make a quick discovery of her whereabouts by others of importance to her own happiness , if not to theirs .
