# text = She had been told that , rough and brutal as they seemed just then , they were not like this all the year round , but were , in fact , quite civil persons save during certain weeks of autumn and winter , when , like the inhabitants of the Malay Peninsula , they ran amuck , and made it their purpose to destroy life -- in this case harmless feathered creatures , brought into being by artificial means solely to gratify these propensities -- at once so unmannerly and so unchivalrous towards their weaker fellows in Nature's teeming family .
