# text = Owing to the action of the sun during the preceding day , the stone was warm and dry , in comforting contrast to the rough and chill grass around , which had damped her skirts and shoes she said , stretching out her hand for his He knelt down beside her outstretched form , and put his lips upon hers she murmured Clare though she might as well rest here till it should get a little lighter , and he flung his overcoat upon her , and sat down by her side she asked , when they had listened a long time to the wind among the pillars
